# Data Model — Naija Eye Tracker

Simple model designed for a primary care nurse with low digital literacy.

### 1. Why This Model
We don't need hospital EHR complexity. We need to answer: "Who was referred and did they arrive?"

### 2. Core Tables (or Objects)

#### A. Patient Screening (De-identified)

#### B. Eye Findings (WHO Primary Eye Care)

#### C. Referral Task (This is what we track)

#### D. Follow-up Log

### 3. FHIR Mapping (Learning goal at Karolinska)
- Patient Screening -> FHIR Patient (with limited identifiers) + Observation (VA)
- Eye Findings -> FHIR Observation + Condition (red flag)
- Referral Task -> FHIR ServiceRequest + Task
- Follow-up Log -> FHIR Task.history

This mapping will be done properly during Health Informatics studies at KI.

