### 5. Dashboard Logic (For Nurse)
- Today: Show all with status = Referred AND days_since_referral > 7
- Urgent: Show Emergency referrals with status != Completed AND days > 1
- Lost: Show Lost_to_Followup for discussion with community health officer

### 6. What I Learned From Boripe Data
- 41/72 lost = 56.9% loss rate. Main reason = no phone, travelled, cost.
- System must work with focal person in village, not only direct phone.
- Need Yoruba language option for contact script.

